                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0eb7d7a7-17bc-4c69-9a40-88dadaf57b4d",
                                "sense_id": "8a597f61-d1e6-3a99-820d-432d8c84e2f8",
                                "text": "Al onze correspondentie van de afgelopen jaren heb je bewaard, beweer je op een toon alsof je een wapen achter de hand hebt. Ik heb alles weggegooid. Ik vond het waardeloze brieven. Jij wilde mij kleineren, omdat jij boos was dat ik niet in jullie slachtofferrol mee wilde gaan.",
                                "translation": "You preserved all our correspondence from the past few years, you claim using a tone as if you've got a strong argument that can't be ignored. I threw it all away. I thought the letters were worthless. You wanted to make me feel small, because you were angry that I refused to join you in your position of a victim.",
                                "english": "You preserved all our correspondence from the past few years, you claim using a tone as if you've got a strong argument that can't be ignored. I threw it all away. I thought the letters were worthless. You wanted to make me feel small, because you were angry that I refused to join you in your position of a victim."
